  "problems": [
    "Pane hidden: screenshots failed, so add results were judged from the minicart totals only.",
    "Three items tried (Nike Par remera 149.999 twice, Nike Club gorra about 69.999, Nike Par pantalon 229.999). After each add the size choice set skuId, but the minicart total stayed at ARS 36.999.",
    "The page shows a reCAPTCHA presentation element (no visible challenge). The refusal may come from an invisible check or from the hidden pane; the reviewer should check the evidence.",
    "Start count of 1 is inferred from the minicart total, because item rows were not exposed in the accessibility tree. The lingering item was probably left by session 1. Nothing was removed.",
    "The cart page is only at /checkout/#/cart (VTEX), a forbidden checkout path segment, so even after a successful add only the minicart could have been captured.",
    "Cookie banner offered only accept or configure, with no decline, so it was left alone.",
    "Product URLs were opened by URL from links on the home page (links were off-canvas for clicks)."
  ],
